<title>GERMANY: German BHW starts trade at 28 marks.</title>
<headline>German BHW starts trade at 28 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in newly-floated German savings, finance and insurance group BHW Holdings AG were traded at 28 marks ($16.17) in initial dealings on Monday, two marks above their 26 mark issue price.</p>
<p>BHW said over the weekend that offers to buy 685 million shares were made during its bookbuilding process, which meant the issue volume of 47 million shares had been oversubscribed 14.5 times.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.731 German Marks)</p>
